            "value" : "自动续订须遵守相关条款；以下链接将在默认浏览器中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mac.subscription.benefit_aipad_p1" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop ChatGPT, Codex, or Cursor into the hub and one tap on iPhone turns the phone into a dedicated controller for that agent — the whole vibe-coding loop, from launching a run to steering what it does next, moves into your hand instead of staying on the keyboard and trackpad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ChatGPT、Codex、Cursor 放进九宫格，在 iPhone 上一点，手机就成为这个 agent 的专属控制器——从发起运行到引导它的下一步，整个 vibe coding 循环握在手里，而不是黏在键盘和触控板上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mac.subscription.benefit_aipad_p2" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Approve or redirect what the agent proposes, dial its reasoning up or down, and dictate prompts by voice — transcribed on the iPhone, dropped into the Mac composer, sent with a tap — so you can keep an agent moving from the couch, the kitchen, or two meters from the screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "批准或纠偏 agent 的提议、上下调节它的推理强度、按住用语音口述提示词——在 iPhone 本机识别成文字、落进 Mac 输入框、一点发送——躺沙发、进厨房、离屏幕两米，都能让 agent 持续推进。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mac.subscription.benefit_aipad_p3" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every client ships a layout tuned to its own workflow and every control is remappable. Combine it with multi-page hubs to run AI coding, writing, and everyday apps from a single remote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个客户端都有贴合自身工作流的默认布局，且每个控件都可自定义映射；配合多页九宫格，用一套遥控器统筹 AI 编程、写作与日常应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mac.subscription.benefit_aipad_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
